WEBVTT

00:00:01,330 --> 00:00:08,050
Hello everybody, this is Dr. Kevin Connors again answering your important questions.

00:00:08,050 --> 00:00:13,130
How about this question, can you give me medical advice?

00:00:13,130 --> 00:00:17,650
Everybody wants to know medical advice sometimes because they're not trusting the advice

00:00:17,650 --> 00:00:23,210
that they're getting from their oncologist or their medical doctor and I get that.

00:00:23,210 --> 00:00:25,850
It's a big decision making process.

00:00:25,850 --> 00:00:29,770
Should you do this therapy or that therapy or this drug or that drug?

00:00:29,770 --> 00:00:35,130
These are big tough decisions and you do want to gain as much information from as many

00:00:35,130 --> 00:00:40,050
different sources as possible so that you can weigh out your decision and be able to

00:00:40,050 --> 00:00:44,730
really understand how to pray about it and how to come about your decision making process.

00:00:44,730 --> 00:00:49,890
But the simple answer to this is can we give out medical advice?

00:00:49,890 --> 00:00:50,890
The answer is no.

00:00:50,890 --> 00:00:57,970
I'm not a licensed medical doctor and I don't pretend to be one and I don't give out medical

00:00:57,970 --> 00:00:58,970
advice.

00:00:58,970 --> 00:01:04,290
We are try very diligently to stay within our scope of practice.

00:01:04,290 --> 00:01:12,610
Our scope of practice and the purpose that God has us here for is to use specific nutrition,

00:01:12,610 --> 00:01:19,050
different herbs, different neuters, neutersuticles, make recommendation and diet, support you emotionally

00:01:19,050 --> 00:01:26,090
and spiritually and use frequencies, God given frequencies because that's when everything

00:01:26,090 --> 00:01:33,210
all better is this energy vibrating in a frequency to use those to help your body heal.

00:01:33,210 --> 00:01:36,210
We're not healing directly through those things.

00:01:36,210 --> 00:01:40,810
We're not giving you a piece of nutrition that's going to go in there and kill your cancer.

00:01:40,810 --> 00:01:42,810
That's not how it works.

00:01:42,810 --> 00:01:47,050
Anything we're doing is we're stimulating your body trying to clean up the maloo of where

00:01:47,050 --> 00:01:52,810
the cancer is to help with detoxification processes so that your body can heal.

00:01:52,810 --> 00:01:55,130
We do not give medical advice.

00:01:55,130 --> 00:02:03,050
We cannot tell you what to do or counteract anything that your medical doctor slash oncologist

00:02:03,050 --> 00:02:07,650
slash radiologist or surgeon has told you to do.

00:02:07,650 --> 00:02:09,450
That is not our position.

00:02:09,450 --> 00:02:15,370
Now, we can lead you down different pathways in the way that, hey, look at this information.

00:02:15,370 --> 00:02:20,570
Here's some studies, do your own research, do a search on that.

00:02:20,570 --> 00:02:25,570
We can encourage that or we're not going to tell you what to do or not to do.

00:02:25,570 --> 00:02:30,130
That leads to the next question, will you tell me whether I should do chemo or immunotherapy

00:02:30,130 --> 00:02:33,010
or surgery or radiation?

00:02:33,010 --> 00:02:35,930
The answer is no, we won't.

00:02:35,930 --> 00:02:38,450
We can't, again, that's medical advice.

00:02:38,450 --> 00:02:42,210
We can't tell you to do or not to do something.

00:02:42,210 --> 00:02:48,130
We can help you walk through that decision as a brother or sister in Christ.

00:02:48,170 --> 00:02:55,330
We can help you walk through that decision given maybe a balanced approach to the data

00:02:55,330 --> 00:03:02,690
that's out there so that you can know what to, it's going to be the best thing for you,

00:03:02,690 --> 00:03:08,330
but understand, we are not dogmatically in position against chemo or radiation or surgery.

00:03:08,330 --> 00:03:11,690
I think it has saved many people's lives.

00:03:11,690 --> 00:03:14,970
That's, that's be realistic about it.

00:03:15,050 --> 00:03:22,890
I think to have a practitioner that's so dogmatically positioned either way is, is, is not just for you.

00:03:22,890 --> 00:03:28,410
So there's a time when chemo, radiation, surgery is the right thing to do.

00:03:28,410 --> 00:03:35,170
And I can't tell you if that is that for you, you have to make that decision for yourself.

00:03:35,170 --> 00:03:40,490
I know we all want to give responsibility to somebody else and I know we're trying to seek

00:03:40,570 --> 00:03:47,890
the right thing out for us to do, but all I can do is lead you to help ask different questions,

00:03:47,890 --> 00:03:51,690
lead you through some of the data and give you my knowledge about it.

00:03:51,690 --> 00:03:54,530
You have to make your decision ultimately.

00:03:54,530 --> 00:03:57,130
That is your responsibility.

00:03:57,130 --> 00:04:00,770
And lastly, can I get information and advice on my medication?

00:04:00,770 --> 00:04:04,610
I'm trying to get off of these steroids or I want to go off of this.

00:04:04,610 --> 00:04:06,530
How do I weed off of this?

00:04:06,530 --> 00:04:07,610
Don't ask us that.

00:04:07,650 --> 00:04:08,810
That's not our place.

00:04:08,810 --> 00:04:10,450
That's not where we're to help you with.

00:04:10,450 --> 00:04:12,290
You can do whatever you want.

00:04:12,290 --> 00:04:18,530
We highly suggest you talk to the prescribing physician in your case if you're wanting to get off something

00:04:18,530 --> 00:04:22,490
or to utilize something, but that's outside of our scope.

00:04:22,490 --> 00:04:25,930
Our purpose is to be available to you.

00:04:25,930 --> 00:04:29,090
We will be available on our Zoom calls.

00:04:29,090 --> 00:04:33,530
We're available on a visit by visit basis.

00:04:33,530 --> 00:04:35,130
You can call and make an appointment.

00:04:35,130 --> 00:04:36,130
We're here to talk.

00:04:36,130 --> 00:04:42,570
We're here to throw ideas out to work through some of the thought processes.

00:04:42,570 --> 00:04:44,410
We're here to retest.

00:04:44,410 --> 00:04:49,050
Understand that once you get tested with us, we may need to retest as your body's chemistry

00:04:49,050 --> 00:04:50,050
changes.

00:04:50,050 --> 00:04:54,850
We're here to tweak and we're here to pray for you because ultimately, we know that God

00:04:54,850 --> 00:04:59,050
has sovereign in all things and we're here to bring Him glory.

00:04:59,050 --> 00:05:04,370
So anything that we could do to help you walk through this pathway that you're walking

00:05:04,370 --> 00:05:09,010
through, maybe with little support of your family, maybe with great support.

00:05:09,010 --> 00:05:13,810
But we can guide you in different ways, but we cannot give you medical advice or make medical

00:05:13,810 --> 00:05:14,810
suggestions for you.

00:05:14,810 --> 00:05:20,170
That decision does come down to you and that is your responsibility.

00:05:20,170 --> 00:05:27,530
So seek the wisdom of a multitude of counselors that would be my advice to you as well.

00:05:27,530 --> 00:05:29,850
Know that we'll be praying for you through all things.

